  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Expenditure verification of Grant Contracts: 429-029 (MCT FSM) and 412531 (Live &amp; Learn Fiji) - &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Expenditure Verifier is expected:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- To carry out the agreed-upon procedures listed in Annex 2 and&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- To issue reports based on the template in Annex 3 which will support the Contracting Authority&apos;s conclusions on the eligibility of the reported expenditure and the related follow-up.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The expenditure verification will be performed as a desk review from the location of the auditor.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
